      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients commend named groomers and front desk staff on Cook Road for their warmth, friendliness, and dedication to repeat visitors. Pet owners appreciate helpful customer service during drop-off and pickup. However, several dissatisfied patrons describe rude interactions with workers, noting unhelpful responses from staff when handling concerns or complaints."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Loving attention alongside handling concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous reviewers report that groomers treat their dogs with genuine love, keeping pets calm, happy, and relaxed throughout styling appointments. Regular customers highlight affectionate care that makes their animals feel like family. Conversely, multiple critical reviews express alarm over rough handling, with owners citing anxious pets, bruises, or pulled ears after visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fluffy styling with occasional grooming misses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A large number of owners praise the clean, fluffy, and fragrant haircuts their pets receive, highlighting great styling and attractive fur-coloring add-ons. Many repeat clients emphasize that dogs leave looking gorgeous. At the same time, dissatisfied customers report uneven trims, uncut hygiene areas, missed teeth cleaning, or small nicks that required extra care at home."
      }
    }
